---
title: "withdraw_collateral - Withdraw Collateral from Obligation (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version_check: check version matches
    q_version_check --> q_check_lock: version valid
    q_version_check --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: revert

    q_check_lock --> q_check_owner: obligation not locked
    q_check_lock --> q_error_locked: obligation locked
    q_error_locked --> [*]: revert 770

    q_check_owner --> q_update_oracle: obligation_key.obligation_id == obligation.id
    q_check_owner --> q_error_owner: not owner of obligation
    q_error_owner --> [*]: revert 0

    q_update_oracle --> q_accrue_interest: x_oracle price feed updated
    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_collateral: compound_interest(market, clock)

    q_calc_collateral --> q_calc_health: collateral_value = sum(collateral_i * price_i * collateral_weight_i)
    q_calc_health --> q_calc_debt: debt_value = sum(debt_j * price_j * borrow_weight_j)
    q_calc_debt --> q_check_remaining: remaining_collateral = collateral_value - withdraw_value_weighted

    q_check_remaining --> q_withdraw: remaining_collateral >= debt_value
    q_check_remaining --> q_error_too_much: withdraw would make position unhealthy
    q_error_too_much --> [*]: revert 1795

    q_withdraw --> q_update_obligation: obligation.collaterals[T] -= withdraw_amount
    q_update_obligation --> q_emit: extract coin from obligation
    q_emit --> [*]: emit CollateralWithdrawEvent, return Coin

    note right of q_check_owner
        INV-001: only obligation_key owner can withdraw collateral (authorization check)
    end note

    note right of q_check_remaining
        INV-002: after withdrawal, collateral_value_weighted >= debt_value_weighted (position remains healthy)
        INV-003: risk_level = debt_value_weighted / collateral_value_weighted_liquidation < 100% after withdrawal
    end note
